    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1187">

                <pb facs="1021" n="917" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg917"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.93/31.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-06-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chinese Chargé d’Affaires has requested that American consuls in disturbed
                    districts be instructed to extend protection to Chinese citizens when in
                    distress or danger.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
